OL,3,GNEWSAPolice officer who forged
OL,4,Asignatures sentenced
OL,5,
OL,6,FA former police officer who forged
OL,7,Fsignatures on witness statements has
OL,8,Fbeen given a suspended jail sentence.
OL,10,FBethany Hemstock, 30, of Bounty Drive,
OL,11,FHull, signed three statements in other
OL,12,Fpeople's names in relation to three
OL,13,Fshop thefts in Hull between 31 October
OL,14,Fand 12 December 2024.
OL,16,FShe had admitted misconduct in public
OL,17,Foffice before she was sentenced to
OL,18,Feight months, suspended for 12 months,
OL,19,Fat Grimsby Crown Court on Monday. She
OL,20,Fwas also ordered to undertake 200 hours
OL,21,Fof unpaid work.
OL,23,APub: 02-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
