OL,3,GNEWSAPolice officer who forged
OL,4,Asignatures sentenced
OL,5,
OL,6,FReferring to Hemstock's previous work
OL,7,Fas an officer, Judge John Thackray KC
OL,8,Fsaid: "All of that hard work, bravery
OL,9,Fand diligence has been undone by your
OL,10,Fcatastrophic error of judgement."
